&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the main point of contact for customer inquiries regarding bookings, allocations, contract terms, and shipment updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage day-to-day freight allocation requests and coordinate capacity requirements with the procurement team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide timely and accurate information on shipment status, allocation availability, and schedule changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate customer records and case documentation within CRM systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle customer disputes related to freight rates, surcharges, contracts, and service issues&lt;/li&gt;
