&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with carriers, operations, procurement, and finance teams to resolve customer and billing issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor allocation utilization and proactively communicate capacity constraints or opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and close customer cases within agreed service-level targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to customer service reporting and process improvement initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the maintenance and enhancement of customer service procedures and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate complex customer matters appropriately while ensuring excellent customer experience throughout the resolution process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
