&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of ocean freight operations, shipping documentation, carrier tariffs, and Incoterms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native-level German and fluent English communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with CRM platforms such as Salesforce, Zendesk, or similar systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and interpret freight contracts, rate sheets, and customer agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial understanding of ocean freight billing and invoice validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office applications, especially Outlook, Excel, and Word&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple customer cases and priorities simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer service or logistics certifications (e.g., FIATA, IATA) are considered an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
