&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-focused with a strong service mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional and composed in challenging customer situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and able to work effectively under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative team player with excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, reliable, and solutions-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable within a dynamic and fast-paced logistics environment&lt;/li&gt;
